      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guilford%2C_Connecticut",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Henry Whitfield House, built in 1639, stands as Connecticut’s oldest stone dwelling and a landmark of early colonial architecture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
